WEBVTT

cue-1
00:00:00.079 --> 00:00:07.019
[upbeat music] Come now, why so shy? Just
say our candidates will have your vote

cue-2
00:00:07.019 --> 00:00:09.1000
and these yellow boys are all your own.

cue-3
00:00:10.679 --> 00:00:14.739
Surely a generous recompense for a mere
pittance of effort.

cue-4
00:00:16.139 --> 00:00:22.520
No, sir. Though I be not a wealthy man, I
cannot, in good

cue-5
00:00:22.520 --> 00:00:29.179
conscience, sell that which is my duty to
sacred crown and country. A man's

cue-6
00:00:29.179 --> 00:00:33.720
votes should follow his principles, not
his purse.

cue-7
00:00:33.720 --> 00:00:38.399
Oh, why did I marry this fool? What is the
point of him being qualified to vote if

cue-8
00:00:38.399 --> 00:00:41.979
he's not prepared to have his votes
bought? He's been offered a handful of

cue-9
00:00:41.979 --> 00:00:48.619
guineas if only he pledges his vote, but
he says he's above bribery. Ridiculous. If

cue-10
00:00:48.619 --> 00:00:53.479
I could vote, I can tell you I'd be
selling my support to the highest bidder.

cue-11
00:00:53.479 --> 00:00:59.779
Thou blockhead husband, gold refuse, when
here's your child in want of shoes.
